cene snaps into a hard spin cut — synchronized to the wet, gurgling crescendo of a bong reaching its full percolation. We slam back to the basement.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":560},"style":"narration"},"bsm_16":{"next":"bsm_17","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":560},"message":"doubles over the table in a monumental coughing fit, a thick cloud of smoke escaping in every direction."},"bsm_17":{"next":"bsm_18","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":520,"y":560},"label":"CAM — 1 — CLOSEUP on Neil McManistan","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_18":{"next":"bsm_19","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":560},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_19":{"next":"bsm_20","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":560},"message":"They must think that I''m retarded. You''d have to be retarded not to put this together, and as sure as Barb took the kids the Jews will get me for this."},"bsm_20":{"next":"bsm_21","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":720},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_21":{"next":"bsm_22","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":720},"message":"Jesus christ Neil we talked about this shit man you''re gonna get us kicked off public access we need this man."},"bsm_22":{"next":"bsm_23","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":720},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_23":{"next":"bsm_24","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":720},"message":"Im sorry, I''m sorry where was I. I''ll tell you where I was, I was at the grocery store and they had a coupon, Tim Horton''s iced coffee syrup, save 2 dollars. And you know how I feel about Singh Hortons..."},"bsm_24":{"next":"bsm_25","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":720},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_25":{"next":"bsm_26","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":880},"message":"CUT!"},"bsm_26":{"next":"bsm_27","text":"A beep sounds. Neil nods at the camera. The show resumes.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":300,"y":880},"style":"narration"},"bsm_27":{"next":"bsm_28","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":880},"message":"gives the camera a slow, deliberate nod."},"bsm_28":{"next":"bsm_29","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":740,"y":880},"label":"CAM — 1 — CLOSEUP on Neil McManistan","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_29":{"next":"bsm_30","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":880},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_30":{"next":"bsm_31","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":1040},"message":"these fuckin grocery barons are sucking us dry! I had this coupon, and lo and behold, ill give it a go, why not save a few bucks. Regular price 8 bucks, brought it down to 6 with the coupon, but i price matched it down to 6 so the coupon made it 4...."},"bsm_31":{"next":"bsm_32","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":1040},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_32":{"next":"bsm_33","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":1040},"message":"What the fuck are you talking about and get to the point!"},"bsm_33":{"next":"bsm_34","text":"The Captain Nguyen delivers this in a frantic whisper from somewhere just off-camera. It is not a quiet whisper.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":740,"y":1040},"style":"narration"},"bsm_34":{"next":"bsm_35","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":1040},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_35":{"next":"bsm_36","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":1200},"message":"Anyways I went back into the place for some vittles a week later, no 2 dollar off coupons, but the same bottle of syrup was now 2 dollars cheaper now that there were no coupons. Those greedy pricks they must think that we are SAPS!"},"bsm_36":{"next":"bsm_37","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":1200},"message":"slams his fist on the table. The ashtray goes airborne. The camera jerks up and snaps directly into Neil''s face."},"bsm_37":{"next":"bsm_38","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":520,"y":1200},"label":"CAM — 1 — SNAP_TIGHT on Neil McManistan","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_38":{"next":"bsm_39","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":1200},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_39":{"next":"bsm_40","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":1200},"message":"Don''t even get me started on that shithole hortons, its harder than Chinese calculus trying to get a jesus coffee in there, they gotta get some teenage girls in there, not like that, not at all, never..."},"bsm_40":{"next":"bsm_41","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":1360},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_41":{"next":"bsm_42","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":1360},"message":"Jesus christ man you can''t keep saying that shit."},"bsm_42":{"next":"bsm_43","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":1360},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_43":{"next":"bsm_44","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":1360},"message":"Pause, no diddy, respectfully."},"bsm_44":{"next":"bsm_45","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":1360},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_45":{"next":"bsm_46","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":1520},"message":"THATS NOT HELPING!"},"bsm_46":{"next":"bsm_47","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":1520},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_47":{"next":"bsm_48","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":1520},"message":"And now a word from our sponsor:"},"bsm_48":{"next":"bsm_49","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":740,"y":1520},"label":"CAM — 3 — SWING to the far corner of the basement","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_49":{"next":"bsm_50","text":"The camera drifts wide to catch the far corner of the basement. Perched on a barstool, just at the edge of the visible set, is an old Vietnamese man. He is holding a small brown paper bag. He has been there the entire time.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":1520},"style":"narration"},"bsm_50":{"next":"bsm_51","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":1680},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_51":{"next":"bsm_52","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":1680},"message":"Who the hell is that?!"},"bsm_52":{"next":"bsm_53","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":1680},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_53":{"next":"bsm_