ext":"bsm_68","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":2160},"message":"And now a word from our sponsors."},"bsm_68":{"next":"bsm_69","type":"event","_vine":{"x":740,"y":2160},"event_type":"COMMERCIAL_BREAK"},"bsm_69":{"next":"bsm_70","type":"title_card","_vine":{"x":960,"y":2160},"graphic_id":"hungry_man_just_meats_logo"},"bsm_70":{"next":"bsm_71","text":"The basement drops away. We cut to a commercial. A sad man sits alone at a kitchen table, staring at a wall.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":2320},"style":"narration"},"bsm_71":{"next":"bsm_72","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":300,"y":2320},"label":"CAM — 4 — CLOSEUP on the sad man","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_72":{"next":"bsm_73","type":"event","_vine":{"x":520,"y":2320},"event_type":"DISSOLVE"},"bsm_73":{"next":"bsm_74","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":740,"y":2320},"label":"CAM — 5 — WIDE dream sequence — sunlit park","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_74":{"next":"bsm_75","text":"A dream blooms into colour. The man pushes his child on a playground swing. Nearby, his partner holds a new baby and smiles at him — warm, full, genuine. This is everything. This is his whole life.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":2320},"style":"narration"},"bsm_75":{"next":"bsm_76","text":"A thundercrack. A man on a Harley-Davidson roars up onto the grass, dismounts, kicks the baby, and begins making out with the man''s wife. The kid on the swing jumps off, turns to face the camera, and speaks.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":2480},"style":"narration"},"bsm_76":{"next":"bsm_77","text":"Loser.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":300,"y":2480},"style":"raw"},"bsm_77":{"next":"bsm_78","text":"The whole family piles onto the Harley and rides away without a backward glance. The man sinks to his knees. He begins to weep.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":520,"y":2480},"style":"narration"},"bsm_78":{"next":"bsm_79","text":"A figure approaches from the right: a large man in a foam rubber Salisbury steak costume. He sits beside the crying man and places an arm around him in silence.\r\n\r\nA second figure approaches from the left: a rectangular man in a chicken patty costume, carrying a glass of whiskey. He hands it over.\r\n\r\nA third figure lumbers in from the rear — shaped like a rib patty, boombox on one shoulder. Creed is playing. He reaches a thick slab-like arm forward and passes the crying man a lit joint.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":740,"y":2480},"style":"narration"},"bsm_79":{"next":"bsm_80","type":"event","_vine":{"x":960,"y":2480},"event_type":"DISSOLVE"},"bsm_80":{"next":"bsm_81","text":"The man is back in his kitchen. He is cleaned up. Shaved. Wearing a pressed shirt. On the table before him sits a Hungry Man dinner tray — wall to wall meat. Not a vegetable in sight. He looks at it the way a man looks at his oldest friend.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":2640},"style":"narration"},"bsm_81":{"next":"bsm_82","text":"It''s just the meats.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":300,"y":2640},"style":"raw"},"bsm_82":{"next":"bsm_83","text":"She can''t control you anymore, king.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":520,"y":2640},"style":"raw"},"bsm_83":{"next":"bsm_84","type":"event","_vine":{"x":740,"y":2640},"event_type":"RETURN_FROM_BREAK"},"bsm_84":{"next":"bsm_85","text":"The camera fades back to the basement. Neil is at the table. There are three more cigarette butts in the ashtray than there were before the break. He does not acknowledge this. The pendulum bulb has slowed to a gentle sway.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":2640},"style":"narration"},"bsm_85":{"next":"bsm_86","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":80,"y":2800},"label":"CAM — 1 — MEDIUM on Neil McManistan","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_86":{"next":"bsm_87","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":2800},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_87":{"next":"bsm_88","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":2800},"message":"Where was I..."},"bsm_88":{"next":"bsm_89","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":2800},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_89":{"next":"bsm_90","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":2800},"message":"Maybe we should move on."},"bsm_90":{"next":"bsm_91","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":2960},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_91":{"next":"bsm_92","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":2960},"message":"MAYBE YOU SHOULD MOVE ON!"},"bsm_92":{"next":"bsm_93","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":2960},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_93":{"next":"bsm_94","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":2960},"message":"You know that''s not what I meant. Let''s get to the top 10."},"bsm_94":{"next":"bsm_95","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":2960},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_95":{"next":"bsm_96","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":3120},"message":"OK here''s my top ten conspiracy theories of the week, as always I will be fielding calls but only at the end of the programme please, I know our phone lines are already lighting up, our operators are standing by..."},"bsm_96":{"next":"bsm_97","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":3120},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_97":{"next":"bsm_98","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":3120},"message":"No one calls this show. This phone isn''t even that type of phone. It''s a payphone. You have a basement payphone. I didn''t even think that was possible."},"bsm_98":{"next":"bsm_99","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":3120},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_99":{"next":"bsm_100","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":3120},"message":"She fuckin took everything man..."},"bsm_100":{"next":"bsm_101","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":3280},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_101":{"next":"bsm_102","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":3280},"message":"Let''s try and move on."},"bsm_102":{"next":"bsm_103","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":3280},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_103":{"next":"bsm_104","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":3280},"message":"That''s what Barb told my kids and my dog."},"bsm_104":{"next":"bsm_105","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":3280},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_105":{"next":"bsm_106","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":3440},"message":"For christ sake."},"bsm_106":{"next":"bsm_107","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":3440},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_107":{"next":"bsm_108","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":3440},"message":"Just put the fuckin number up man, put up my number so my fans can call in."},"bsm_108":{"next":"bsm_109","text":"1-800-273-8255 ←── NEIL''S HOTLINE — OPERATORS STANDING BY ←── 1-800-273-8255 ←── CENTAUR SHREDS ON ←── DON''T LET HER WIN, BROTHER! — HULK HOGAN ←── CALL NOW ←── 1-800-273-8255 ←── NEIL''S HOTLINE ←──","type":"ticker","_vine":{"x":740,"y":3440}},"bsm_109":{"next":"bsm_110","text":"The number crawls across the bottom of the screen. It is the suicide hotline. It is being towed by a centaur playing electric guitar. Behind the centaur, a graphic element features Hulk Hogan pointing directly at the audience with one finger. He appears to be saying something encouraging.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":3440},"style":"narration"},"bsm_110":{"next":"bsm_111","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":3600},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_111":{"next":"bsm_112","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":3600},"message":"WHAT THE FUCK WAS THAT MAN?! WAS THAT THE SUICIDE HOTLINE NUMBER?!"},"bsm_112":{"next":"bsm_113","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":3600},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_113":{"next":"bsm_114","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":3600},"message":"And why was Hulk Hogan involved?"},"bsm_114":{"next":"bsm_115","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":3600},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_115":{"next":"bsm_116","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":3760},"message":"The Hulkster was your idea."},"bsm_116":{"next":"bsm_117","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":3760},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_117":{"next":"bsm_118","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":3760},"message":"Why the hell was it my idea when was that ever my idea to have Hulk Hogan telling my audience not to kill themselves?!"},"bsm_118":{"next":"bsm_119","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":3760},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_119":{"next":"bsm_120","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":3760},"message":"I got a voicemail at 3 am. It sounded like you were drunk but you were quite insistent that we should use the Hulkster in a graphic for the show."},"bsm_120":{"next":"bsm_121","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":3920},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_121":{"next":"bsm_122","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":3920},"message":"Since when did that mean get the Hulkster to tell my fans not to kill themselves after the divorce?! I was watching the Netflix documentary!"},"bsm_122":{"next":"bsm_123","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":3920},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_123":{"next":"bsm_124","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":3920},"message":"That''s on me. I thought you''d appreciate the levity."},"bsm_124":{"next":"bsm_125","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":3920},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_125":{"next":"bsm_126","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":4080},"message":"The Hulkster wouldn''t stand for this. It was all a smear anyways, and we all know why..."},"bsm_126":{"next":"bsm_127","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":4080},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_127":{"next":"bsm_128","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":4080},"message":"What are you talking about man?"},"bsm_128":{"next":"bsm_129","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":4080},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_129":{"next":"bsm_130","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":4080},"message":"These Hollywood jews hate to see a blonde haired blue eyed macho friend of Jesus win."},"bsm_130":{"next":"bsm_131","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":4240},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_131":{"next":"bsm_132","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":4240},"message":"You can''t keep saying jews!"},"bsm_132":{"next":"bsm_133","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":4240},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_133":{"next":"bsm_134","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":4240},"message":"Why is Barb gonna go get her big jew lawyer to come after me, you know they love to litigate —"},"bsm_134":{"next":"bsm_135","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":4240},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_135":{"next":"bsm_136","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":4400},"message":"Jesus!"},"bsm_136":{"next":"bsm_137","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":4400},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_137":{"next":"bsm_138","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":4400},"message":"YOU CANT SQUEEZE BLOOD FROM A STONE BARBRA I KNOW WHO DROVE US APART AND I HEARS THE TRUTH IS REALLY BAD!"},"bsm_138":{"next":"bsm_139","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":4400},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_139":{"next":"bsm_140","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":4400},"message":"IS REALLY BAD."},"bsm_140":{"next":"bsm_141","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":4560},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_141":{"next":"bsm_142","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":4560},"message":"ISRAELI BAD!"},"bsm_142":{"next":"bsm_143","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":4560},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_143":{"next":"bsm_144","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":4560},"message":"PRESS THE RED BUTTON NGUYEN!"},"bsm_144":{"next":"bsm_145","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":960,"y":4560},"label":"CAM — 3 — SWING to Nguyen in the corner","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_145":{"next":"bsm_146","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":80,"y":4720},"npc_id":"npc_nguyen"},"bsm_146":{"next":"bsm_147","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":4720},"message":"reaches out and presses the large red button mounted to the wall beside his barstool."},"bsm_147":{"next":"bsm_148","text":"From a speaker of indeterminate location, a single word is announced at considerable volume.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":520,"y":4720},"style":"narration"},"bsm_148":{"next":"bsm_149","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":740,"y":4720},"label":"CAM — 1 — BACK to Neil McManistan","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_149":{"next":"bsm_150","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":4720},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_150":{"next":"bsm_151","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":4880},"message":"You can''t have a Jew button are you insane!"},"bsm_151":{"next":"bsm_152","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":4880},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_152":{"next":"bsm_153","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":4880},"message":"THEN WHY DO THESE JEWS KEEP PUSHING MY BUTTONS?!"},"bsm_153":{"next":"bsm_154","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":4880},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_154":{"next":"bsm_155","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":4880},"message":"I''m cutting to break."},"bsm_155":{"next":"bsm_156","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":80,"y":5040},"npc_id":"npc_neil_mcmanistan"},"bsm_156":{"next":"bsm_157","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":5040},"message":"seizes Camera 1 and wrenches it toward Nguyen."},"bsm_157":{"next":"bsm_158","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":520,"y":5040},"npc_id":"npc_captain_nguyen"},"bsm_158":{"next":"bsm_159","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":5040},"message":"grabs Camera 1 from the other side and hauls it back."},"bsm_159":{"next":"bsm_160","text":"The camera swings wildly between the two men, catching ceiling, floor, the laundromat pipes, and half-illuminated faces in roughly equal measure.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":5040},"style":"narration"},"bsm_160":{"next":"bsm_161","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":5200},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_161":{"next":"bsm_162","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":5200},"message":"DO YOU HAVE TROUBLE GETTING IT UP CUZ YOUR WIFE WAS AN UGLY PIG?!"},"bsm_162":{"next":"bsm_163","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":5200},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_163":{"next":"bsm_164","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":5200},"message":"Give me that!"},"bsm_164":{"next":"bsm_165","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":5200},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_165":{"next":"bsm_166","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":5360},"message":"WELL LOOK NO FURTHER THAN Captain Nguyen''S MAGIC ROOT! AVAILABLE VIA PAYPAL —"},"bsm_166":{"next":"bsm_167","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":300,"y":5360},"label":"CAM — 1 — SNAPS to Nguyen''s midsection","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_167":{"next":"bsm_168","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":520,"y":5360},"npc_id":"npc_nguyen"},"bsm_168":{"next":"bsm_169","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":5360},"message":"reaches into his trousers and produces a strange, gnarled red root, which he holds aloft with quiet dignity."},"bsm_169":{"next":"bsm_170","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":5360},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_170":{"next":"bsm_171","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":5520},"message":"THAT''S ENOUGH! I''VE HAD ENOUGH! I''M PULLING THE PLUG —"},"bsm_171":{"next":"bsm_172","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":5520},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_172":{"next":"bsm_173","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":5520},"message":"She took everything. I''m living off tinned beans here. Let a man eat."},"bsm_173":{"next":"bsm_174","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":5520},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_174":{"next":"bsm_175","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":5520},"message":"And now a word from our sponsor."},"bsm_175":{"next":"bsm_176","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":80,"y":5680},"npc_id":"npc_captain_nguyen"},"bsm_176":{"next":"bsm_177","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":5680},"message":"releases Camera 1 and it drops to the concrete floor."},"bsm_177":{"next":"bsm_178","text":"The camera hits the floor and settles at a forty-five-degree angle. The image holds there. In the background, the argument continues to dissolve into ambient noise.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":520,"y":5680},"style":"narration"},"bsm_178":{"next":"bsm_179","type":"event","_vine":{"x":740,"y":5680},"event_type":"COMMERCIAL_BREAK"},"bsm_179":{"next":"bsm_180","type":"title_card","_vine":{"x":960,"y":5680},"graphic_id":"jerry_rosenberg_logo"},"bsm_180":{"next":"bsm_181","text":"Cut to exterior. California. The sun is aggressively bright. A convertible sports car rolls up a coastal road to the sound of smooth jazz.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":5840},"style":"narration"},"bsm_181":{"next":"bsm_182","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":300,"y":5840},"label":"CAM — 6 — WIDE on the beach","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_182":{"next":"bsm_183","text":"The camera pans to the beach. An attractive woman and her handsome personal trainer are doing Pilates together. They are very in sync. They are having a genuinely lovely time.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":520,"y":5840},"style":"narration"},"bsm_183":{"next":"bsm_184","text":"A man in a crisp linen suit steps into frame. He has the easy confidence of someone who has never once paid his own parking tickets.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":740,"y":5840},"style":"narration"},"bsm_184":{"next":"bsm_185","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":960,"y":5840},"npc_id":"npc_jerry_rosenberg"},"bsm_185":{"next":"bsm_186","text":"Do you ever wonder what your life could be, if this guy wasn''t holding you back?","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6000},"style":"raw"},"bsm_186":{"next":"bsm_187","text":"The footage cuts abruptly to grainy home video: a man in a wife-beater and dirty underpants, cracking a beer and lighting a cigarette while a baby plays with a fork near a wall socket.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6000},"style":"narration"},"bsm_187":{"next":"bsm_188","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6000},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_188":{"next":"bsm_189","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6000},"message":"WTF IS THAT ME?!"},"bsm_189":{"next":"bsm_190","text":"The ad continues, undeterred.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6000},"style":"narration"},"bsm_190":{"next":"bsm_191","text":"The lawyer steps back into frame. He is now dressed as a mohel. He adjusts his equipment.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6160},"style":"narration"},"bsm_191":{"next":"bsm_192","text":"Let''s bris this schmuck. Now cheaper — with our ten percent off circumcision discount! Spouses of gentiles now save ten percent!","type":"say","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6160},"style":"raw"},"bsm_192":{"next":"bsm_193","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6160},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_193":{"next":"bsm_194","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6160},"message":"YOU LET THEM RUN AN AD FOR MY EX WIFE''S JEW LAWYER?!"},"bsm_194":{"next":"bsm_195","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6160},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_195":{"next":"bsm_196","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6320},"message":"He pays good money —"},"bsm_196":{"next":"bsm_197","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6320},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_197":{"next":"bsm_198","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6320},"message":"THAT''S MY MONEY!"},"bsm_198":{"next":"bsm_199","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6320},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_199":{"next":"bsm_200","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6320},"message":"He''s a friend of the show."},"bsm_200":{"next":"bsm_201","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6480},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_201":{"next":"bsm_202","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6480},"message":"HE IS NOT A FRIEND OF THE SHOW THIS GUY RUINED MY LIFE —"},"bsm_202":{"next":"bsm_203","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6480},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_203":{"next":"bsm_204","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6480},"message":"I''m muting your microphone."},"bsm_204":{"next":"bsm_205","text":"Neil''s protests continue at length, reduced by the muted mic to a distant, indistinct hum. The ad presses on without him.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6480},"style":"narration"},"bsm_205":{"next":"bsm_206","text":"The lawyer returns, now dressed as a Hasid. He squares up to the camera with evident satisfaction. He begins to recite his contact information at a measured pace. Then his eyes go wide. His hands come together — slowly, fingers interlacing.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6640},"style":"narration"},"bsm_206":{"next":"bsm_207","text":"For all your divorce needs, come to Jerry Rosenberg Family Law — where we will make him pay. And make him pay for me too!","type":"say","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6640},"style":"raw"},"bsm_207":{"next":"bsm_208","text":"From somewhere behind the muted microphone, Neil can be observed commenting at some volume. The exact words are inaudible. The feeling is clear.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6640},"style":"narration"},"bsm_208":{"next":"bsm_209","type":"event","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6640},"event_type":"RETURN_FROM_BREAK"},"bsm_209":{"next":"bsm_210","text":"The camera — which has been lying on the floor of the basement at a forty-five-degree angle for the duration of the break — is picked up by an unseen hand and levelled. It finds Neil already mid-sentence, microphone apparently reinstated.","type":"say","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6640},"style":"narration"},"bsm_210":{"next":"bsm_211","type":"camera_cut","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6800},"label":"CAM — 1 — MEDIUM on Neil McManistan","zone_id":"zone_studio_1782953094650"},"bsm_211":{"next":"bsm_212","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6800},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_212":{"next":"bsm_213","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6800},"message":"Who makes an ad like that? That''s like three antisemitic self-burns in a row. He looks like Jude Süss up there. This is egregious! I''m too riled up to continue. Nguyen, roll the credits!"},"bsm_213":{"next":"bsm_214","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6800},"npc_id":"npc_nguyen"},"bsm_214":{"next":"bsm_215","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6800},"message":"rises from his barstool and produces a large flip chart from behind him with the calm efficiency of a man who was prepared for this."},"bsm_215":{"next":"bsm_216","text":"HOST\r\nNeil McManistan\r\n\r\nLEGEND\r\nNeil McManistan\r\n\r\nCAMERA\r\nNeil McManistan\r\n\r\nNARRATOR\r\nNeil McManistan\r\n\r\nDIVORCE WINNER\r\nNeil McManistan\r\n\r\nBIG GUY\r\nNeil McManistan\r\n\r\nProducer\r\nCaptain Nguyen\r\n\r\nTRAITOR\r\nGabe Owners","type":"credits","_vine":{"x":80,"y":6960},"duration":45},"bsm_216":{"next":"bsm_217","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":6960},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_217":{"next":"bsm_218","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":6960},"message":"DIVORCE WINNER?!"},"bsm_218":{"next":"bsm_219","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":6960},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_219":{"next":"bsm_220","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":6960},"message":"Oh fuck off!"},"bsm_220":{"next":"bsm_221","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":7120},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_221":{"next":"bsm_222","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":7120},"message":"YOU CAN''T JUST CREDIT Captain Nguyen AS THE Captain Nguyen! I''M THE Captain Nguyen!"},"bsm_222":{"next":"bsm_223","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":520,"y":7120},"message":"flips to the next page of the flip chart."},"bsm_223":{"next":"bsm_224","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":7120},"message":"Captain Nguyen:"},"bsm_224":{"next":"bsm_225","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":7120},"message":"Real mature, man. Real mature. Your buddy Nguyen couldn''t captain a rowboat — whipping out his root on live television, what the fuck was that?! She was right to leave you, man."},"bsm_225":{"next":"bsm_226","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":7280},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_226":{"next":"bsm_227","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":300,"y":7280},"message":"... fair observation..."},"bsm_227":{"next":"bsm_228","type":"npc_anchor","_vine":{"x":520,"y":7280},"npc_id":"npc_neil_mcmanistan"},"bsm_228":{"next":"bsm_229","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":740,"y":7280},"message":"pensively lights a cigarette, furrows his brow, and stares into the middle distance."},"bsm_229":{"next":"bsm_230","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":960,"y":7280},"message":"Neil Mcmanistan:"},"bsm_230":{"next":"bsm_231","type":"npc_action","_vine":{"x":80,"y":7440},"message":"Join us next week when we are joined by our special guest — my wife''s personal trainer — where we will fight a grudge match to the death!"},"bsm_231":{"type":"event","_vine":{"x":300,"y":7440},"event_type":"FADE_OUT"}},"_start":"bsm_0"}'::jsonb, 'ch_7_1782953079593', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
